  // Central-bank meeting runs + IMM FRA runs.
  // Meeting runs: dates/mids from the meeting-dated OIS tickers (N=0 run-down matures at the next
  // meeting); SNB mids from the SARON futures strip; hardcoded dates are the last-resort fallback.
  // kind="fra" runs: quoted 3M IMM FRA strips (tickers matched to rows by MATURITY — the numbers
  // are rolling generics), curve-implied only when no tickers are listed. NOK MUST stay on the
  // quoted strip: its curve has no 3M band, so curve-implied rows read the 6M curve, ~3s6s high.
  // pastDates = trailing-year decisions, used only to stitch meeting-ticker HISTORY across rolls.
  // decisionTimeLondon = announcement time on the London clock.
  // A config\meetings.json next to the exe overrides this file.
